  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s 2 Pocket BDU Shirt offers an ideal blend of functionality and style, perfect for active-duty personnel, law enforcement, public safety personnel, and more. Crafted with durable materials with double-stitched seams and reinforced elbow patches, this long-sleeve shirt ensures both comfort and durability throughout the day. Featuring 2 front bellowed chest pockets, the BDU shirt provides ample space for storing essential items, making it convenient for everyday carry (EDC).</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "1147",
  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s 2 Pocket BDU Shirt offers an ideal blend of functionality and style, perfect for active-duty personnel, law enforcement, public safety personnel, and more. Crafted with durable materials with double-stitched seams and reinforced elbow patches, this long-sleeve shirt ensures both comfort and durability throughout the day. Featuring 2 front bellowed chest pockets, the BDU shirt provides ample space for storing essential items, making it convenient for everyday carry (EDC). The classic button-up design includes a flap cover to hide the buttons and epaulets on each shoulder, offering a formal appearance. Additionally, the adjustable button tab wrist cuffs allow for a customizable fit, ensuring maximum comfort during wear. Whether you're on duty or enjoying outdoor activities, Rothco&rsquo;s Tactical 2 Pocket BDU Shirt is a versatile choice that meets the demands of various professions and lifestyles.</p>",
